            "review_title": "Review at Kaoya Hotpot",
            "review_text": "Mike D\nHua Hin, Thailand671 contributions\n0\nGreat (if the owner isn't there)\nOct 2025 • Couples\nWe spotted this restaurant as we were passing by, we decided to go in and eat.\n\nThe food and service was very good but halfway through our meal some guy walked in (I think he's the owner), he was dressed all in pink and the sides of his head was shaved, he brought in a bunch of flowers, which is fine but he decided that he needed to start decorating right then and there.\n\nWhen he was at the table next to us his rear end was in my face, he then went behind us and stood on a chair, his rear end was that pointed at my wife's head. All the while he was talking, very loud and annoying. \n\nThe staff was great and if I was rating my experience on them and the food alone I would give 5 stars. Unfortunately the crazy antics of the owner lowered the final score by two stars.\n\nSo if you are lucky enough to dine there while the owner is away, you have a good chance of enjoying yourself. If the owner is there you may have a less than optimal experience.\nRead more\nWritten October 6, 2025",
            "rating": 3.0,
