            "review_text": "Dr Minsari V\n9 contributions\n0\nWorst customer service in Hanoi\nDec 2023 • Couples\nIt's near Dong Xuan and likely thrives on attracting unsuspecting tourists because I don't see how the place is still running. The food is just okay and the service is terrible. The waiters were sat on one of the tables upstairs connected to sockets giggling and scrolling away. Walked to them for help. Also they way they handled the food they werebserving was rather unhygienic.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 19, 2023",
