            "review_title": "Review at Kaoya Hotpot",
            "review_text": "Jacob\n2 contributions\n0\nHave a meal at Kaoya Hotpot restaurant\nJul 2023 • Friends\nI heard from everyone that this restaurant has Chinese style food, they have quite eye-catching dishes, mainly fried and grilled dishes. Their roast duck noodle is quite delicious, it looks very artistic at first glance, the roasted duck meat is evenly golden in color and very fragrant, the fried noodles are quite chewy, it's amazing. The restaurant's fried rice with char siu is also quite delicious, looking from afar is enough to feel delicious because of the color of the dish, the rice is fried evenly with different vegetables, but the food is processed for a long time.\nRead more\nWritten August 22, 2023",
